    "detailed_description": "&quot;Skateboard Gravity: A Journey into the Gravitational World&quot;. Get ready for an exciting adventure in a world where gravity becomes your best friend!<br />\r\nSkateboard Gravity is an exciting platformer with a side view and incredible gameplay that takes you to an exciting world of the future, where a hero on a skateboard controls gravity. In this exciting game you will have a unique opportunity to switch between different directions of gravity to overcome obstacles, collect money and conquer new levels.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures of the game:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGravity control: Your character, a professional skater of the future, has a special device that allows you to change gravity. This allows you to roll along the ceilings and even in flight change the direction of gravity to complete the levels.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nExciting levels: Immerse yourself in the world of the future, full of amazing locations. Each level offers new challenges and puzzles that can be completed using your skill and gravity.",
    "about_the_game": "&quot;Skateboard Gravity: A Journey into the Gravitational World&quot;. Get ready for an exciting adventure in a world where gravity becomes your best friend!<br />\r\nSkateboard Gravity is an exciting platformer with a side view and incredible gameplay that takes you to an exciting world of the future, where a hero on a skateboard controls gravity. In this exciting game you will have a unique opportunity to switch between different directions of gravity to overcome obstacles, collect money and conquer new levels.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures of the game:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGravity control: Your character, a professional skater of the future, has a special device that allows you to change gravity. This allows you to roll along the ceilings and even in flight change the direction of gravity to complete the levels.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nExciting levels: Immerse yourself in the world of the future, full of amazing locations. Each level offers new challenges and puzzles that can be completed using your skill and gravity.",
